     1313   DEFINE VARIABLE T-dis-card AS LOGICAL INITIAL no
     1314        LABEL "Только покупки по картам"
     1315        VIEW-AS TOGGLE-BOX
     1316        SIZE 26.63 BY 1 NO-UNDO.
     1317   DEFINE VARIABLE T-scale AS LOGICAL INITIAL no
